          <tr><td>O₂²⁻</td><td>18</td><td>1</td><td>Dia</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <ul class="notes">
        <li>s-p mixing: Li₂ to N₂ | No mixing: O₂, F₂, Ne₂</li>
        <li>With s-p mixing: σ2p has MORE energy than π2p</li>
